# =============================================================================
# WHITELIST .gitignore — public deployment repo (decision 2026-08-20, pass-6 refine)
# Everything is IGNORED unless explicitly re-included below. This repo ships ONLY:
# the Streamlit app, the pipeline (+ its lib and inputs), and the client-facing
# method docs. Internal Factory material (BUILD_PLANs, briefs, post-mortems,
# progress notes, tests, reports) NEVER ships — by mechanism, not by care.
# =============================================================================
/*

# --- root files that ship ---
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/config.yaml
!/run_all.py

# --- the app (incl. deployed data + pinned requirements) ---
!/Streamlit/

# --- the pipeline + its vendored lib + manual inputs ---
!/pipeline/
!/lib/
!/inputs/

# --- tests + ops SHIP since pass 7a (P7-R7/P15, S-EVAL) -- REVERSES the
#     2026-08-20 whitelist decision above, for these two paths ONLY: goldens
#     ship (no secrets -- grep-proven Bearer|OPENALEX_API_KEY|sk- absent),
#     requirements-dev.txt documents pytest/playwright for an operator who
#     wants to run the suite. .venv-pinned/ stays ignored (no whitelist line
#     below -- caught by the blanket /* above, verified: git check-ignore -v
#     .venv-pinned). ---
!/tests/
!/ops/
!/requirements-dev.txt

# --- docs: ONLY the data contracts (60_deploy validates against them)
#     and the client-facing method docs README links to ---
!/docs/
/docs/*
!/docs/data_contract.yaml
!/docs/METHODES.md
!/docs/SHIFT_v1_v2.md
!/docs/AUDIT.md
!/docs/PROVENANCE.md
!/docs/REGISTRE_OBJETS.md
!/docs/foundry/
/docs/foundry/*
!/docs/foundry/data_foundation.yaml

# --- hygiene inside whitelisted dirs ---
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.streamlit/secrets.toml

# --- tests/ hygiene (P15) -- __pycache__/ above already matches at any depth,
#     incl. tests/**/__pycache__/ ; tests/ui/_shots/ not added, no such output
#     folder exists on disk as of pass 7a (checked) ---
/tests/stress/reports/

# --- files the SHIPPED tests open at runtime (P15 follow-up, manager 2026-09-10): the hover
#     contract, the narrative banlist + chart-key registry + lib API contract, and the frontier
#     method note README links to. Without these a fresh clone's `pytest tests` fails. ---
!/docs/tooltip_spec.yaml
!/docs/TOOLTIP_SPEC.md
!/docs/FRONTIERNESS_METHOD.md
!/docs/contract_fragments/
